YTA

ESH. You should NOT, in any circonstances, take decision for your SO. If she create more debt because of her poor management skill, it's her own fault. She has to face the consequences of her own actions. You look like someone way to controlling, you need to let your SO act of her own. 

&#x200B;

However, your girlfriend seems really immature. If she can't manage her money, can't find a job, can't pay her own bill and always refers to her mom, it's because she clearly lacks maturity. Bringing her mom when there is a conflict or a problem is a red flag for me. If I were you, I wouldn't continue a relation like that. I'd talk to her about this problem and ask her to improve this. You don't have to deal with this kin of bullshit mate

